/- English proof (citation)
Apply `GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.HermitianCommuting.exists_maximal_commuting_hermitian_subspace` to the given parameters and hypotheses. The parameters and hypotheses occur in the same order in both statements, and the conclusions agree.

